{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40354","headline":"寄孙储 · 孙定","name":"寄孙储","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"行行血泪洒尘襟，事逐东流渭水深。\n秋跨蹇驴风尚紧，静投孤店日初沈。\n一枝犹挂东堂梦，千里空驰北巷心。\n明月悲歌又前去，满城烟树噪春禽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙定","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40354.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40354","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}